### 15. Quest Behaviors Deep Dive: Hook/State Leak Fixes, Vehicle Aim Completion, & Core Cleanup (2026-11-07) - Completed
* **Scope**: Audited `Quest Behaviors/` (239+ C# files, HB dynamic compile target: .NET 4.5.1 / C# 5 / x86) for hook/filter leaks, incomplete TODOs, and safe correctness/performance improvements. Full project build verified: `Quest Behaviors/QBs.csproj` (Debug|x86) compiles with 0 errors.
* **Hook / Event / Targeting Leaks Fixed**:
  - [`AscendInWater.cs`](file:///D:/Games/GH%20of%20HB/Quest%20Behaviors/AscendInWater.cs): fixed `static` `MaxAscendTimer` (shared across behavior instances) by making it per-instance; stored the `Combat_Main` hook composite and removed it in `OnFinished()` with an `IsOnFinishedRun` guard; added `AscendStop()` cleanup.
  - [`EscortGroup.cs`](file:///D:/Games/GH%20of%20HB/Quest%20Behaviors/EscortGroup.cs): unsubscribed `Targeting.Instance.IncludeTargetsFilter` in `OnFinished()` and fixed `Combat_Only` hook removal (previously removed the combat-only composite from `Combat_Main`).
  - [`MrFishIt.cs`](file:///D:/Games/GH%20of%20HB/Quest%20Behaviors/MrFishIt.cs): fixed Lua event cleanup (`LOOT_CLOSED` was re-attached instead of detached in `OnFinished()`); detach both loot events defensively.
  - [`SpecificQuests/24958-LostIsles-Volcanoth.cs`](file:///D:/Games/GH%20of%20HB/Quest%20Behaviors/SpecificQuests/24958-LostIsles-Volcanoth.cs), [`SpecificQuests/25066-LostIsles-ThePrideofKezan.cs`](file:///D:/Games/GH%20of%20HB/Quest%20Behaviors/SpecificQuests/25066-LostIsles-ThePrideofKezan.cs), [`SpecificQuests/30855-KunLai-TheFallofShaiHu.cs`](file:///D:/Games/GH%20of%20HB/Quest%20Behaviors/SpecificQuests/30855-KunLai-TheFallofShaiHu.cs): added/implemented missing `Combat_Main`/`Combat_Only` hook removal in `OnFinished()` to prevent stale hooks after quest completion or behavior teardown.
* **Incomplete Features Completed**:
  - [`QuestBehaviorCore/Utility/VehicleWeapon.cs`](file:///D:/Games/GH%20of%20HB/Quest%20Behaviors/QuestBehaviorCore/Utility/VehicleWeapon.cs): completed vehicle-rotation TODOs by compensating ballistic aim for active-mover pitch (`WoWMovement.ActiveMover.MovementInfo.Pitch`, radians) so world-relative launch solutions are converted to vehicle-relative articulation angles for `WeaponArticulation`/`VehicleAimIncrement`. `CalculateTimeOfProjectileFlight` now uses the world launch angle for flight time; roll compensation remains unavailable on HB 5.4.8 movement info.
  - [`SpecificQuests/27738-Uldum-ThePitOfScales.cs`](file:///D:/Games/GH%20of%20HB/Quest%20Behaviors/SpecificQuests/27738-Uldum-ThePitOfScales.cs): enabled the previously TODO'd `WoWMathHelper.IsInPath` penalty when selecting croc eggs, preferring eggs not in the target's path to the player (`Styx.Helpers.WoWMathHelper.IsInPath` API confirmed in `Honorbuddy.exe`).
* **Defensive Cleanup**:
  - [`ForceSetVendor.cs`](file:///D:/Games/GH%20of%20HB/Quest%20Behaviors/ForceSetVendor.cs): replaced `NotImplementedException("Unexpected VendorType")` with a logged attribute error and graceful break; modern usage remains `DoMail/DoRepair/DoSell/DoTrain`.
* **Verification**:
  - `& "C:\Windows\Microsoft.NET\Framework\v4.0.30319\MSBuild.exe" "D:\Games\GH of HB\Quest Behaviors\QBs.csproj" /p:Configuration=Debug /p:Platform=x86 /nologo /v:minimal /m` → build succeeded, 0 errors (pre-existing obsolete-API warnings in untouched quest behaviors remain).* **MrPlow AddOn Coroutine Boundary & Options Sync (`Interface/AddOns/MrPlow/`)**:
  - **Incident**: Running `MrPlow` threw `attempt to yield across metamethod/C-call boundary` at `MrPlow\PlowEngine.lua:807` (`coroutine.yield(self)` inside `MassSort`) called from `PlowScheduler.OnUpdate` (`PlowEngine.lua:915`).
  - **Root Cause**: `PlowScheduler.OnUpdate` (a C-to-Lua `OnUpdate` handler running on the main thread) invoked `nextCall[1](...)` directly as a normal function call instead of wrapping it in the `sortbags` coroutine (`coroutine.create`). Whenever a bag slot was still locked from the preceding `Restack`/`Defragment` job (`select(3, infoFunc(bag, slot)) == true`), `MassSort` (or `Restack`) executed `coroutine.yield(self)` across the C `OnUpdate` boundary.
  - **Fix**: Wrapped initial job dispatch in `PlowScheduler.OnUpdate` inside `sortbags = coroutine.create(...)` with protected `coroutine.resume`, added slot-lock yielding and state persistence to `Consolidate` and `Defragment`, fixed numeric vs. string `IgnoreItems` / `SortItemID` lookups, guarded `ReverseProcessBags` and `CanGoInBag` against nil arguments, and synced the complete `MrPlow` addon (including `PlowOptions.lua` GUI and embedded Ace3 libraries) between `D:\Games\TwinStar WoW\Interface\AddOns\MrPlow` and `Interface/AddOns/MrPlow/`.


